ty::Standard), 5);\n    }\n\n    #[test]\n    fn express_skips_handling() {\n        assert_eq!(lead_time_days(1200, Priority::Express), 3);\n    }\n\n    #[test]\n    fn short_express_routes_promise_next_day() {\n        assert_eq!(lead_time_days(100, Priority::Express), 1);\n    }\n}\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":23,"oldLines":6,"newStart":23,"newLines":12,"lines":["     days.max(1)"," }"," ","+/// Promised lead time in days for a route, shortened by loyalty credit days.","+/// Clamped to at least 1 day, like `lead_time_days`; callers cast to unsigned.","+pub fn lead_time_days_with_credit(route_km: u32, priority: Priority, credit_days: u32) -> i64 {","+    (lead_time_days(route_km, priority) - credit_days as i64).max(1)","+}","+"," #[cfg(test)]"," mod tests {","     use super::*;"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
